OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CTuesday:FDry and bright to start the
OL,6,Fday with any lingering cloud to the
OL,7,Feast soon clearing. Lengthy sunny
OL,8,Fspells throughout, with cloud and rain
OL,9,Fspilling into the west later.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:
OL,12,FTurning wet and windy on Wednesday.
OL,13,FClearing before turning showery with
OL,14,Fsunny spells into Thursday with
OL,15,Flighter winds. Then heavy rain will
OL,16,Fspread northeastwards into Friday with
OL,17,Fstrong winds likely.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
